      "fileName": "castigating-weapon.json",
      "id": "tSmd0cxq9wokSCh4",
      "name": "Castigating Weapon",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "tSmd0cxq9wokSCh4",
        "folder": "P2BbwdXCk0b81V6f",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Castigating Weapon",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The force of your deity's castigation strengthens your body so you can strike down the enemy and its allies. After you deal spirit damage due to Divine Castigation, your weapon or unarmed Strikes gain your holy or unholy trait and deal additional spirit damage until the end of your turn. The spirit damage is equal to the rank of harm or heal you dealt spirit damage with, and is in addition to any spirit damage the weapon already deals (such as from a holy rune).</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Divine Castigation"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "Note",
              "predicate": [
                "divine-castigation",
                {
                  "or": [
                    "item:slug:harm",
                    "item:slug:heal"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "selector": "spell-damage",
              "text": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Cleric.CastigatingWeapon.Note",
              "title": "{item|name}"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "cleric"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 10,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "heroic-recovery.json",
      "id": "KR78kinMmAZQHeoa",
      "name": "Heroic Recovery",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "KR78kinMmAZQHeoa",
        "folder": "P2BbwdXCk0b81V6f",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Heroic Recovery",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The restorative power of your healing invigorates the recipient. If the next action you use is to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heal] targeting a single living creature and the target regains Hit Points from the spell, the target also gains three bonuses until the end of its next turn: a +5-foot status bonus to its Speed, a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, and a +1 status bonus to damage rolls. In addition, if the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], it can immediately Stand as a free action that doesn't trigger reactions.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Heroic Recovery]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "healing font"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "RollOption",
              "label": "PF2E.TraitSpellshape",
              "mergeable": true,
              "option": "spellshape",
              "placement": "spellcasting",
              "suboptions": [
                {
                  "label": "{item|name}",
                  "value": "heroic-recovery"
                }
              ],
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "itemType": "spell",
              "key": "ItemAlteration",
              "mode": "add",
              "predicate": [
                "spellshape:heroic-recovery",
                "item:slug:heal"
              ],
              "property": "description",
              "value": [
                {
                  "text": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Spellshape.HeroicRecovery"
                },
                {
                  "text": "@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Heroic Recovery]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
