          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Striking out against your enemies draws praise and protection from your deity. When you damage a creature with a Strike using your deity's favored weapon, you gain a number of temporary Hit Points equal to half your level, or equal to your level if the Strike was a critical hit. These temporary Hit Points last until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Replenishment of War]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
